# Line endings — LF everywhere, in every shipped file.
# This is a project convention (НФТ-9 / NFR-9), enforced by CI's hygiene job and
# by tools/Invoke-ProjectDoctrine.ps1. Declaring it here means a clone on
# Windows cannot introduce CRLF into the work tree in the first place.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalized, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.whl binary
*.tar.gz binary

# GitHub language statistics.
# Documentation and measurement artifacts are not source code: the language bar
# should describe the product (Python), not the prose around it.
docs/** linguist-documentation
LICENSE linguist-documentation
CHANGELOG.md linguist-documentation
bench/results/** linguist-generated
